ation-invariant self-attention in transformer-based language models\n\t\t\n\t\t\tUlmeWennberg\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tGustavEjeHenter\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2021","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":null},{"raw_text":"Transformers: State-of-the-art natural language processing\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThomasWolf\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLysandreDebut\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tVictorSanh\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJulienChaumond\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tClementDelangue\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAnthonyMoi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPierricCistac\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTimRault\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tRémiLouf\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMorganFuntowicz\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJoeDavison\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSamShleifer\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tClaraPatrick Von Platen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYacineMa\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJulienJernite\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tCanwenPlu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTevenXu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSylvainLe Scao\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMariamaGugger\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tQuentinDrame\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAlexanderMLhoest\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tRush\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tProceedings of the 2020 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing: System Demonstrations\n\t\tthe 2020 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing: System DemonstrationsOnline\n\t\t\n\t\t\tOctober 2020\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\tAssociation for Computational Linguistics","doi":null,"arxiv_id":null,"title":"Transformers: State-of-the-art natural language processing"},{"raw_text":"DA-transformer: Distance-aware transformer\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChuhanWu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFangzhaoWu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYongfengHuang\n\t\t\n\t\t10.18653/v1/2021.naacl-main.166\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tProceedings of the 2021 Conference of the North American Chapter\n\t\tthe 2021 Conference of the North American Chapter\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAssociation for Computational Linguistics\n\t\t\tJune 2021","doi":"10.18653/v1/2021.naacl-main.166","arxiv_id":null,"title":"DA-transformer: Distance-aware transformer"},{"raw_text":"WojciechZaremba\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tIlyaSutskever\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tOriolVinyals\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t